name: utility_transformer_loss_map
description: "Loss by transformer area - each metered transformer at the centre of the premises it supplies, one point per month, coloured by loss_band. TX-007 (Leicester) and TX-019 (Coventry) move over the 15 % threshold after the tampering visits. Synthetic placements, city-level. The Geo map needs Standard or above; on Basic open transformer_loss in Discover instead."
sourceId: dataset
display: markers
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: transformer_loss_dataset
    latCol: lat
    lonCol: lon
    entityCol: transformer_id
    entityIdCol: transformer_id
    kindCol: loss_band
camera:
  center[2]: -1.3,52.67
  zoom: 8.5
